.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Goal of this page
    %p.mb-3
      Anyone can propose a
      %strong new Seat
      as an apply-ready draft—including primary and additional titles, team, and reports-to. People who can create Seats today review submitted proposals and apply or reject them.

    %h2.h5 How create proposals move
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Start a draft here (or upload markdown with a stable create_key).
      %li Edit title(s), needed-by date, classification, team, reports-to, and prose fields.
      %li Submit when ready. Submitted proposals also appear in the MAAP Cleanup Inbox.
      %li A Seat creator applies (creates the Seat in draft) or rejects.
